        "{\"a2uiMeta\":{\"note\":\"Texas hold'em it is, heads-up against the dealer. Blinds are 10/20, so you post the 10 and act first. Each of you gets two hole cards, then the board comes out as flop, turn and river, with a betting round before each. Best five of seven wins. You start with 1,000 chips.\",\"trace\":{\"turnIndex\":0,\"query\":{\"intent\":\"## Referenced for this message\\n### texas-holdem (resource)\\ntexas hold'em, hole cards, flop, turn, river, community cards\\n\\nHeads-up hold'em against the dealer: two hole cards each, then a shared flop (three cards), turn, and river, with a betting round before each street — check, bet, call, raise, or fold, staked from the running chip count. Best five-card hand from the seven wins the pot, standard rankings (high card up to royal flush). Reveal both hands honestly at showdown.\\n\\nLet's play Texas hold'em.\",\"k\":3},\"exemplarIds\":[\"domain-croupier-card-table-round\",\"frontier-round-outcome\",\"wallet-summary-card\"],\"rounds\":1,\"healed\":0,\"failureCodes\":[],\"model\":\"claude-haiku-5-5\",\"prompt\":{\"limit\":142000,\"total\":57507,\"sections\":[{\"id\":\"grammar\",\"chars\":25605},{\"id\":\"components\",\"chars\":20517},{\"id\":\"functions\",\"chars\":145},{\"id\":\"few-shot\",\"chars\":4794},{\"id\":\"mini-skills\",\"chars\":1532},{\"id\":\"persona\",\"chars\":4914}],\"over\":false},\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":4664,\"outputTokens\":4120,\"cacheReadInputTokens\":17507,\"cacheCreationInputTokens\":0},\"miniSkillIds\":[\"card-game-sheet\",\"card-layout\",\"login-form\"],\"cacheBoundary\":46267}}}",
